        "content": "# File associations (todos/0072), consulted by the desktop/fileman GUI\n# opens and by open(1). Three layers overlaid per key, highest wins:\n#   ~/.config/openwith, /etc/openwith, /usr/share/openwith\n# Lines: KEY<ws>COMMAND. KEY = lowercase extension or default.gui /\n# default.term; the file path is appended to COMMAND as one argument.\n# Bare program words resolve through /usr/local/bin:/bin. GUI commands\n# should be windowed apps (wrap tty programs: `term vi`).\ngb\t/bin/sameboy\ngbc\t/bin/sameboy\ngba\t/bin/mgba\nnes\t/bin/punes\nbmp\t/bin/paint\nsent\t/bin/sent\nmgp\t/bin/mgp\ndefault.gui\t/bin/notepad\ndefault.term\tvi\n"
